label Day3.lavinia.result.A
# story entry day=3
# art scene draft.reading.early
\“Another evening,” I say toward the gate. “Send a message tomorrow.” #id:line.Day3.lavinia.result.A.001
\Footsteps recede down the hill; the cardigan sleeve swings out of the lamp light. #id:line.Day3.lavinia.result.A.002
\“You could have said that first,” Lavinia says. #id:line.Day3.lavinia.result.A.003
\“I could have said yes.” #id:line.Day3.lavinia.result.A.004
\“You didn't.” #id:line.Day3.lavinia.result.A.005
\“The message will still go out tomorrow.” #id:line.Day3.lavinia.result.A.006
\“I heard.” #id:line.Day3.lavinia.result.A.007
\Her empty hand opens between our coats. #id:line.Day3.lavinia.result.A.008
\“The other side,” I say. #id:line.Day3.lavinia.result.A.009
\Paper rustles as the bouquet shifts to her right arm; moving to her left side brings the unbruised hand into hers. #id:line.Day3.lavinia.result.A.010
\Another evening is not this one. #id:line.Day3.lavinia.result.A.011
label Day3.lavinia.result.A.next
# story marker {"kind":"scene.transition","payload":{"target_id":"target.Day4"}}
return

label Day3.lavinia.result.B
# story entry day=3
# art scene draft.reading.early
\“Not tonight, thank you.” #id:line.Day3.lavinia.result.B.001
\The gate latch clicks shut behind the departing steps. #id:line.Day3.lavinia.result.B.002
\“Don't look so put out,” Lavinia says. #id:line.Day3.lavinia.result.B.003
\“Nothing was said.” #id:line.Day3.lavinia.result.B.004
\“Your mouth changed.” #id:line.Day3.lavinia.result.B.005
\“I'm still walking with you.” #id:line.Day3.lavinia.result.B.006
\A green leaf has caught beneath the torn fold of the florist paper; two fingers free it without touching her wrist. #id:line.Day3.lavinia.result.B.007
\Only the walk, then. #id:line.Day3.lavinia.result.B.008
\Our steps settle into the same cadence along the outer wall, the white bouquet carried between the two coats like a boundary marker. #id:line.Day3.lavinia.result.B.009
label Day3.lavinia.result.B.next
# story marker {"kind":"scene.transition","payload":{"target_id":"target.Day4"}}
